PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. SYSTEM DESIGN

The AI Fitness Plan system is designed to collect user fitness information, analyze the requirements and provide a personalized fitness plan.

2. INPUT

The system takes the following information from the user:

• Fitness goal
• Fitness level
• Available workout time
• Preferred activity

3. PROCESS

1. Collect user information.
2. Analyze the user's fitness requirements.
3. Match the requirements with suitable fitness recommendations.
4. Generate a personalized fitness plan.

4. OUTPUT

The system provides:

• Recommended workout activities
• Suitable workout duration
• Goal-based fitness suggestions
• Personalized fitness plan

5. SYSTEM FLOW

User Input
     ↓
Information Analysis
     ↓
Fitness Recommendation
     ↓
Personalized Plan
     ↓
User Output

6. USER INTERFACE

The interface should be simple and easy to use. Users can enter their basic fitness details and view the generated fitness recommendations.

7. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

User
  ↓
Input Collection
  ↓
AI-based Analysis
  ↓
Recommendation System
  ↓
Personalized Fitness Plan

8. EXPECTED DESIGN OUTCOME

The designed system provides a simple process for converting user fitness requirements into personalized fitness recommendations.
